an type · deep green\n Enable published restaurant page\nWhen customers scan\nOpen menu directly\nShow restaurant page first\n\nPayment returns and existing order/cart tasks resume directly. Existing printed table QR codes keep working.\n\nAccent colour\n02 · Photos & first impression\nRestaurant logo\nHero photograph\nPhoto focal point · 50%\nPhoto horizontal focal point · 50%\n\nUpload JPEG, PNG or WebP up to 20 MB. We orient, resize and compress it automatically. Adjust the focal points and check the mobile crop before publishing.\n\nRestaurant page heading\nCuisine or short tagline\nWelcome message\nMore options · story, gallery, contact & languages\nLaunch checklist · page, menu, payment & test scan\n\nNot published\nDraft saved · Customers currently open the normal QR menu.\n\nSave draft\nReview & publish\nEngagement report · last 30 days\nCopy selected content to other branches\nLive mobile preview\nPreview width\n360 px\n390 px\n430 px\nDesktop\nPreview language\nEnglish\nPreview notice at\nUse current time\nLIVE DESIGN PREVIEW · NO REAL ORDER\nGarden House Flow QA\nALL BRANCHES\n✦\nAll branches\n\nA PLACE AT OUR TABLE\n\nGarden House Flow QA\n\nView menu\n↗\n\nAll branches\n\nAll branches\n\nServed with JAMANVAAR\n\nView menu\n↗\nDisplay",
